    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n11703" root="خوص" body-key="x">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُخَوَّصٌ</span></b>  applied to a crown, <i>Ornamented with
plates of gold like</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خُوص</span> <i>in width:</i> (A, * TA:)
and applied to a vessel, <i>having in it what resemble</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خُوص</span> <i>in shape.</i> (TA.) <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُخَوَّصٌ بِالذَّهَبِ</span>,
applied to <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">دِيبَاج</span> [or silk brocade], <i>Woven with
gold in the form of</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خُوص</span>. (TA.)

